-- fx_rates PRE-2019 extension (currency fix part 2a, item 1b): the initial load covered Jan 2019+
-- only, but sales_archive has ~100 non-USD rows dated before 2019. This adds monthly USD-per-unit rates
-- back to Jan 2000 (same Fed H.10 / FRED source, same direct/inverted series), so backfillUsd.js can
-- convert those pre-2019 rows. Run once in the Supabase SQL editor, after supabase-fx-rates.sql.
-- Idempotent (upserts on the PK). 1824 rows (Jan 2000 to Dec 2018, 8 currencies).

on conflict (currency, month) do update set usd_per_unit = excluded.usd_per_unit;
